rooms_desc ({"This is the Anteroom.There is a coat rack to put your coat onThat is about it for furnishings","There is a tasteful bed in the center of the roomA picture dominates teh western wallThe bed is well made and looks like it can withstand a lot of workThere is something on the bedpost i wonder what it is","This is the legend room.  It is dedicated to celebrating the Legend BrainsprainThe walls are covered with pictures, ranging in subject from the dragons he has killed to the arenas he has won.The biggest picture is of him standing gloating over the dead body of demolian, thefirst player he ever pked, albiet accidentally.In the center of the room is a large overstuffed chair that looks well used.  You get the feeling that someone spends a lot of time sitting there(Full of himslef isnt he)","Where i come to get away from everyone","The northern wall of this room is dominated by a huge stereoComing out of the stereo is Led ZepplinThis seems to be the only thing the stereo can playAlong the east wall is a huge TVThere is a porn flick running at the momentand it is a good one","This is a beautiful room, decked out in flowersIn the center of the room is a table and in the center of the tableis a single candle and a red roseThe finest silver is laid out and a delicious aroma rises up from the simmering dinner",0,0,0,0,})
